sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Client
    actor F as Freelancer
    participant API as Backend
    participant DB as MongoDB
    C->>API: Accept hourly proposal
    API->>DB: Lock one week estimate (rate x weekly hours)
    F->>API: Start timer
    API->>DB: Unbilled work must be below the lock
    F->>API: Stop timer (sessions under 60 s are discarded)
    API->>DB: Create TimeLog, draw down from the lock
    alt Lock covers the amount
        API->>DB: Credit freelancer wallet net of fee, log billed
        API-->>F: Billed
    else Lock is short
        API->>DB: Log stays pending
        API-->>F: Needs top-up
        C->>API: Top up the lock
        API->>DB: Retry pending logs, oldest first
    end
    F->>API: Request to end the contract
    C->>API: Approve the end request
    API->>DB: Settle remaining pending logs
    API->>DB: Refund what is left in the lock to the client wallet
    API-->>C: Contract completed
